F.. CONSENT CALENDAR (APPROVE)  -  Action: approved (Pass) Moved by Amy Thomas Howorth

2.. Conduct a Public Hearing and Consideration of an Informational Report Regarding the Status of Vacancies and Recruitment Efforts, Pursuant to AB 2561, and Authorize the Over Hire of One Police Captain on an Ongoing Basis. (No Budget Impact) (Human Resources Director Jenkins)
